WEBVTT

00:08:27.880 --> 00:08:32.402
If you're lucky enough to decide the pace
that you want to travel through life,

00:08:32.426 --> 00:08:33.831
it's a privilege.

00:08:34.464 --> 00:08:35.615
Use it.

00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:38.967
You might decide that you need
both to speed up

00:08:38.991 --> 00:08:40.994
and to create slow time:

00:08:41.869 --> 00:08:43.599
time to reflect,

00:08:43.623 --> 00:08:45.252
to percolate

00:08:45.276 --> 00:08:46.718
at your own pace;

00:08:47.688 --> 00:08:48.943
time to listen,

00:08:49.611 --> 00:08:50.951
to empathize,

00:08:51.517 --> 00:08:53.059
to rest your mind,

00:08:53.890 --> 00:08:55.818
to linger at the dinner table.

00:08:57.402 --> 00:08:59.387
So as we zoom into the future,

00:08:59.411 --> 00:09:03.172
let's consider setting
the technologies of speed,